### 8\. Testing Conclusion

 The testing phase confirms that **ComicCraft-AI** can transform user-provided ideas into structured comic stories using Gemini models. Functional, integration, AI-output, performance, usability, and security testing help identify problems before deployment. Any inconsistencies in generated stories, dialogues, characters, or images should be addressed through improved prompting, validation, error handling, and model/API configuration.
